WithOptions"," and ",[154,260,261],{},"removeAllSubscriptions"," were denied.",[151,264,265,266,242,269,272,273,276,277,242,280,242,283,286,287,242,290,258,293,296,297,300,301,304],{},"Event listeners (",[154,267,268],{},"onConnected",[154,270,271],{},"onPublication",", ...) get the whole Tauri event again (",[154,274,275],{},"{ event, payload, id }",",\nas typed and as in 0.1.x). 0.2.0 passed only the payload, so ",[154,278,279],{},"onMessage",[154,281,282],{},"onChannelMessage",[154,284,285],{},"onAnyMessage",",\n",[154,288,289],{},"onPublicationRawJson",[154,291,292],{},"onServerPublicationRawJson",[154,294,295],{},"helpers.subscribeToChannel(s)"," threw on every publication.\nCode written for 0.2.0 that reads ",[154,298,299],{},"e.channel"," must read ",[154,302,303],{},"e.payload.channel",".",[143,306,308],{"id":307},"removed","Removed",[148,310,311],{},[151,312,313,314,258,317,320],{},"Stale ",[154,315,316],{},"allow-\u002Fdeny-start-connection",[154,318,319],{},"allow-\u002Fdeny-stop-connection"," permissions (no such commands).",[143,322,194],{"id":323},"added-1",[148,325,326],{},[151,327,328,329],{},"Documentation site: ",[126,330,331],{"href":331,"rel":332},"https:\u002F\u002Fs00d.github.io\u002Ftauri-plugin-centrifugo\u002F",[130],[134,334,336,339],{"id":335},"_020-2026-11-08",[138,337,338],{},"0.2.0"," - 2026-11-08",[143,341,174],{"id":342},"changed-1",[148,344,345,373,388,404,433],{},[151,346,347,351,352,359,360,242,363,242,366,369,370,304],{},[348,349,350],"strong",{},"Breaking:"," the client is now the official Rust SDK ",[126,353,356],{"href":354,"rel":355},"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002Fcentrifugal\u002Fcentrifuge-rust",[130],[154,357,358],{},"centrifuge-client","\ninstead of the internal engine. Its modules (",[154,361,362],{},"client",[154,364,365],{},"config",[154,367,368],{},"protocol",", ...) are no longer re-exported;\nthe SDK is available as ",[154,371,372],{},"tauri_plugin_centrifugo::centrifuge",[151,374,375,376,379,380,383,384,387],{},